# Adobe transform 2, Y and K at 2x2, 33x17), mutated anywhere after SOI —
# frame header, APP14 transform byte, scan headers, entropy — through the CMYK
# entry with a counting Allocator. Its contract is the RGBA entries' plus the
# Allocator one; a success must say it is CMYK (source_color_type 0x1x4).
